; std/measure: the ladder, and a threshold gate that costs nothing.
;
; std-times folds addition, std-at-least compares, and neither fires. The one
; call is the prompt the gate selected.
; expect: calls 1
; expect: clean
; expect: answers
((# std/measure)
 (% (std-at-least (std-times 3 4) 10)
    "Answer with exactly the word: enough"
    "Answer with exactly the word: short"))
